{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15620","headline":"阁前双槿 · 杨凌","name":"阁前双槿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣玉开双槿，丹荣对绦纱。\n含烟疑出火，隔雨怪舒霞。\n向晚争辞蘂，迎朝鬬发花。\n非关後桃李，爲欲继年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}